description: Core always-on quality invariants
alwaysApply: true
---

# Always

## No shortcuts

- NEVER weaken SwiftLint / hooks or skip `validate` to dodge errors
  (unless the user explicitly asks). NEVER `--no-verify`.
- NEVER add `swiftlint:disable` / `// swiftlint:disable` without user **yes**.
  Fix the code, or follow `800-lint-suppression-beg`.
- ALWAYS complete work 100% or stop and ask.

## Validate

- After mid-feature edits: run the root `scripts/validate` (or
  `humanized-type/scripts/validate`). Read **all** failures; fix every
  diagnostic; one confirm.
- NEVER skip the gate; NEVER stop at first error.

## Tests

- ALWAYS write or update a test when changing behavior.
- NEVER implement behavior first and retrofit tests afterward.
